Author: Thiago Macieira <thiago.macieira@intel.com>
Date:   Mon Mar 13 22:28:40 2023 -0700

    QCborStreamReader: add bytesAvailable()

    [ChangeLog][QtCore][QCbotStreamReader] Added bytesAvailable()

    Change-Id: Icfe44ecf285a480fafe4fffd174c31fc44974335
    Reviewed-by: Edward Welbourne <edward.welbourne@qt.io>

 src/corelib/serialization/qcborstreamreader.cpp    | 12 ++++++
 src/corelib/serialization/qcborstreamreader.h      |  1 +
 .../qcborstreamreader/tst_qcborstreamreader.cpp    | 50 ++++++++++++++++++++--
